halo-flash includes code adapted from the following MIT-licensed projects.
Each adapted file says so in its header; full license texts are in licenses/.

- gufo (Copyright (c) 2026 gufo contributors): src/core/gguf.{hpp,cpp},
  src/core/quant.{hpp,cpp}, the BPE merge loop in src/text/tokenizer.cpp, and
  src/model/{config,weights,ngram,cpu_ops,reference}.{hpp,cpp}.
- llama.cpp / ggml (Copyright (c) 2023-2026 The ggml authors): quantized block
  layouts and dequantization in src/core/quant.cpp (via gufo).
- ds4 / DwarfStar (Copyright (c) 2026 the ds4.c authors): design references for
  n-gram disk reads, expert streaming and disk KV checkpoints (licenses/ds4.txt).

halo-scope (src/scope/, built only with -DHALO_SCOPE=ON) adapts code from two
repositories by the halo-flash author, Chuck Cassel. He relicensed the copies
in halo-flash under MIT on 2026-10-03; this applies only to those copies, and
the source repositories keep their own terms. Each adapted file says so in its
header.

- oscope (github.com/chucklehead-dev/oscope), originally EPL-2.0, branch
  claude/brave-pascal-0fecgh at 3a14d2c0b555000df35541fdd2e115b779e7c3b1,
  directory spike/oscope-core:
  - src/chdb.rs -> src/scope/chdb.{hpp,cpp} (libchdb binding: connection,
    binary-safe query, streaming insert, signal handlers off; ported from a
    link-time binding to dlopen);
  - src/ring.rs -> src/scope/ring.hpp (SPSC byte ring: drop-and-count,
    pre-faulted pages, half-full wakeup);
  - src/pipeline.rs, src/recorder.rs -> structure of src/scope/recorder.cpp
    (rings, one writer, batched RowBinary stream inserts).
- casselc/observability (github.com/casselc/observability), commit
  ca7ae8a6250f2af3623d0c0cad26c9710a6bbc4d. The repository has no top-level
  license; the otap-rs crate that holds the SQL declares Apache-2.0 in its
  Cargo.toml (otel-chdb/chdb-go is chDB, Inc.'s Apache-2.0 code and is not
  used here). Relicensed under MIT for halo-flash as above:
  - otel-chdb/otap-rs/sql/llm_spans.sql, llm_payloads.sql, llm_scores.sql ->
    the table shapes in src/scope/schema.cpp (typed llm_observations,
    content-addressed llm_payloads, append-only llm_scores with supersedes);
  - otel-chdb/README.md -> the Null staging table plus materialized view
    write pattern.

Runtime dependencies (not vendored): HRX System, Apache-2.0; libchdb (chDB,
Apache-2.0), loaded with dlopen by halo-scope when present.
Build dependency (fetched at build time, halo-scope only, when no system
sqlite3 is found): the SQLite amalgamation (public domain).
Test dependencies (fetched at build time): GoogleTest (BSD-3-Clause),
hegel-cpp (MIT) with its prebuilt libhegel engine.
